{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2021-09-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF TWO DATA CENTERS IN INDIA', 'text': 'REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., SEPT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD\'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS EXTENDED PLATFORM EQUINIX INTO THE STRATEGIC INDIAN MARKET,\xa0FOLLOWING THE COMPLETION OF THE ACQUISITION OF THE INDIA OPERATIONS OF GPX GLOBAL SYSTEMS, INC. ("GPX INDIA").'}